// MoneroUSD Wallet V2 — Rust core (clean-room, Tauri). The core runs the PQ crypto in-process
// and talks to the user's OWN node on loopback :27780. This file provides:
//   • node_rpc      — a thin bridge to the node's PQ RPC (GET/POST), so the UI never leaks off-device.
//   • ensure_node   — AUTO-NODE-MANAGEMENT: reuse a running node, else start the `usdmd-node serve`
//                     ONCE (probe-first dedupe: generate/restore/startup never spawn a second node).
//   • node_status   — current node reachability + chain tip (for the welcome/Home status line).
// PQ keygen / scan / WHIR-direct prove land in the next core modules (reusing the usdmd_node crates
// in-process); each arrives as its own real command — no empty handlers in this file.
// =========================================================================================

