        // `nf_carrier` maintains that carrier continuously, off this path, so here it costs one
        // `finalize()` — no fold, no page, no term in chain height. `watch` is idempotent and is called
        // here too so a send is never blocked by a note the scan has not registered yet; the follower
        // picks it up on its next pass and the user retries a moment later with the reason on screen.
