        // while the spend-or-decoy WHIR prove below takes appreciably longer than that. Encoding the
        // witness fetched above would ship a carrier that was at the tip when the send STARTED and is two
        // blocks behind by the time it arrives — refused with "rebuild the carrier one block forward",
